Error [E0123]: A source loop stride must be positive
  --> tests/ui/source_stride_not_positive.jet:2:29
    |
  2 |     loop item in [1, 2, 3], 0 -> print(item)
    |                             ^
 Why: Zero or a negative value cannot select a later source item
 Fix: Use a stride of 1 or more
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0123
